    "identifier": "grimnir-true-believer-wrath-of-divinity",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>True Believer · уровень 13</b></p><p>When you deal Sneak Attack damage to a creature, you can deal an additional 3d6 Radiant or Necrotic Damage<br>(your choice).<br>• If you choose Radiant, one creature you can see within 60 feet regains Hit Points equal to the bonus damage dealt.<br>• If you choose Necrotic, the target must succeed on a<br>Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC or have the Frightened condition until the end of your next turn.<br>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your<br>Dexterity Modifier, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Активировать один вариант после Sneak Attack. Radiant лечит выбранного союзника ровно на выпавший урон; применить вручную.</li></ul>"
    },
